  "purpose": "<p>Our remit is to consider the extent to which the policies and programmes of government departments and non-departmental public bodies contribute to environmental protection and sustainable development, and to audit their performance against sustainable development and environmental protection targets.</p>\r\n<p>Follow us on social media:&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/hoccommittees.parliament.uk\">Bluesky</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61579513151155\">Facebook</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ukcommonscommittees\">Instagram</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/house-of-commons-committees\">LinkedIn</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/UKCommonsCommittees/\">Reddit</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://x.com/HoCcommitteesUK\">X</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLj3mInRJqIekxA--aDW780T_TUCwjea4M\">YouTube</a></u></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/email/committeecorridor\">Sign up to the&nbsp;weekly cross-committee newsletter, ‘Committee Corridor’.</a></p>",
